  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, the hole of the socket is plated, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). Cherry MX PCB-mount stabilizer holes included. Stabilizer plate cut on User.5 (fits plate-mount and PCB-mount MX stabilizers).")
  (tags "switch, hot_swap")
